        "build a computer system to understand natural language in many fields after completing this course.",
        "4.2. Chuän dau ra hoc phan (Course learning outcomes)",
        "L.O.1 - Tóng quan vé tö chúc hé thóng xu ly ngön ngu tu nhién va cäc úng dung cúa he thóng",
